in 2018 an original horror film from a  guy best known for starring in the  office premiered and much like the  murderous creatures that part of the  story the buzz quickly spread it wasn't  long before we learned that a quiet  place part two was on the way here's  what we know so far the world of a quiet  place is a whole world despite the  relative isolation of the main  characters at the part of the first film  we only see this strange apocalypse and  the creatures which caused it through  the lens of the Abbott family whose  lives largely revolve around their rural  home and brief trips into nearby towns  to search for supplies we rarely glimpse  other survivors in the film and when we  do they're brief and brutal reminding us  that it's very difficult to stay alive  in this world while the sequel will  expand upon the relatively small scale  of the first film the Abbott family will  remain its focus Emily Blunt Millicent  Simmons and Noah jube will all be back  as Evelyn Regan and Marcus respectively  so if you're eager to see what life is  like for the Abbott's now you're going  to get your wish a quiet place roots its  story in a very personal way offering  very few glimpses of the rest of the  world there is a sense of a larger world  at work beyond the first film single  family story though and unsurprisingly  the second film is going to explore that  writer director John Krasinski explained  the thing that I loved in the movie  where my mind kept wandering as we were  making it was the question of who was on  the other end of those fires when the  father lights the fire and in the  distance those other fires light up how  do those people survive how did that old  man survive that means that in addition  to returning stars who will reprise  their roles as the Abbott's a quiet  place part 2 will feature several new  faces Gillian Murphy and Djimon Hounsou  among others are signed on to play other  survivors in the newly expanded world a  quiet place was John